{"ordinal":11686,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453889662980","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Death_00f458a","source":"Experienced: Редиска паршивая!","target":"Experienced: Jigodie împuțită!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11687,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453889662979","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Death_05b5a72","source":"Experienced: Ну ты и сука тупая. Я думал, ты нормальный мужик. А ты…","target":"Experienced: Bă, da’ prost mai ești, nenorocitule. Credeam că ești un om de treabă. Dar tu…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11688,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453889662978","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Ears_DontShoot_04edde3","source":"Experienced: Я на секунду подумал, что ты и взаправду застрелишь меня из-за туфты, о которой даже в телике не говорили.","target":"Experienced: Pentru o clipă am crezut că mă împuști de-adevăratelea pentru o prostie de care nici la televizor n-au pomenit.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11689,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453889662977","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Ears_DontShoot_0d4d6fa","source":"Experienced: Надо же, одумался.","target":"Experienced: Ia uite, ți-a venit mintea la cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11690,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453889662976","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Photo_DontShoot_08e13dc","source":"Experienced: Меня даже вертухаи так не кошмарили, как ты…","target":"Experienced: Nici gardienii nu m-au terorizat cum ai făcut-o tu…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11691,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468682","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Photo_DontShoot_01da939","source":"Experienced: Ты совсем, что ли, из ума вышел, фраер? За простую фотку убить хотел?","target":"Experienced: Ți-ai pierdut mințile, fraiere? Voiai să mă omori pentru o simplă fotografie?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11692,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Armpit_DontShoot_015432c","source":"Experienced: Чё их переводить понапрасну.","target":"Experienced: De ce să irosești cartușele degeaba?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11693,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Armpit_DontShoot_057681b","source":"Experienced: Поверь, я правильной масти. Зуб даю!","target":"Experienced: Crede-mă, sunt de soiul bun. Jur pe dinții mei!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11694,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468679","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Armpit_DontShoot_082ee13","source":"Experienced: Ты лучше, фраер, прибереги бананчики… То есть патроны свои.","target":"Experienced: Mai bine păstrează-ți bananele… Adică, cartușele, fraiere.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11695,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468678","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Eyes_DontShoot_00e42dc","source":"Experienced: Ты же не бугор отряда на зоне, чтобы всю дурь вышибать из пришедших?","target":"Experienced: Doar nu ești șeful de brigadă din pușcărie, să scoți cu bătaia toate prostiile din cei nou-veniți?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11696,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468677","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Eyes_DontShoot_06886f7","source":"Experienced: Хата-то твоя, базару ноль. Но ты порядки такие лютые не делай.","target":"Experienced: E casa ta, n-am ce zice. Dar nu pune reguli așa de crunte.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
