{"ordinal":11698,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Hands_DontShoot_04b185d","source":"Experienced: Всё-таки не надо чуть что брать на мушку, лады, фраер?","target":"Experienced: Totuși, n-ar trebui să pui pușca pe om la orice fleac, bine, fraiere?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11699,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Hands_DontShoot_09171b8","source":"Experienced: Я знал, конечно, что ты мужик беспардонный, но…","target":"Experienced: Știam eu că ești cam fără obraz, dar…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":11700,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504453885468673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Experienced_Teeth_DontShoot_0125ea1","source":"Experienced: Глядишь, палец дёрнется, и всё — кабзда.","target":"Experienced: Îți tresare degetul și gata, s-a dus totul dracului.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-297.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
